   "widgets_values": [
    "## Text → Pixel Art\nPick a **style** (sets art size, colour count, background). Override art size / colours with non-zero values. Sprite styles get a plain background that is removed automatically.\n\nRaise `batch_size` in *Empty latent* for variations. Outputs land in `output/spritekiln/`."
